flowchart TD
    RecoveryStart([生命周期入口]) --> RecoveryLock[获取全局 APM 锁]
    RecoveryLock -->|失败| RecoveryLockFail[打印锁错误] --> RecoveryLockExit([未获得锁；非零退出])
    RecoveryLock -->|成功| RecoveryJournal{存在未完成 journal?}
    RecoveryJournal -->|检查失败| RecoveryJournalFail[打印 journal 检查错误] --> RecoveryExitError([释放锁并非零退出])
    RecoveryJournal -->|否| RecoveryResume([进入调用方命令流程；锁保持])
    RecoveryJournal -->|是| RecoveryDecide{根据阶段与路径状态判断提交点}
    RecoveryDecide -->|提交点前| RecoveryRollback[回滚上次事务]
    RecoveryDecide -->|提交点后| RecoveryCommit[完成上次事务提交]
    RecoveryRollback --> RecoveryResult{修复成功?}
    RecoveryCommit --> RecoveryResult
    RecoveryResult -->|否| RecoveryFail[保留 journal 并打印修复失败] --> RecoveryExitError
    RecoveryResult -->|是| RecoveryDelete[删除已恢复 journal]
    RecoveryDelete -->|失败| RecoveryDeleteFail[保留 journal 并打印删除失败] --> RecoveryExitError
    RecoveryDelete -->|成功| RecoveryLog[打印回滚或提交及修复内容] --> RecoveryResume
    RecoveryJournal -.进程中断.-> RecoveryInterrupted([内核释放锁；保留 journal；下次命令重新预检])
    RecoveryRollback -.进程中断.-> RecoveryInterrupted
    RecoveryCommit -.进程中断.-> RecoveryInterrupted
    RecoveryDelete -.进程中断.-> RecoveryInterrupted
